{"id":"1d678518961d4d19","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-incompletable-extension.md","title":"Incompletable Extension","display":"df-incompletable-extension — Incompletable Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-incompletable-extension","aliases":["90-df-incompletable-extension"],"display":"df-incompletable-extension — Incompletable Extension","depends_on":["[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","[[90-df-sentence]]","[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-incompletable-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-incompletable-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-incompletable-extension — Incompletable Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g\">\\(S,g\\)</span> (fixed effective signature and effective Gödel numbering)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\">\\(T,U\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-theories)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}\\)</span> (effective-axiomatizability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (metatheoretic consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"714deb184f73887a\" href=\"?note=714deb184f73887a\" title=\"90-df-sentence\">90-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IncompExt}_{S,g,T}\">\\(\\mathrm{IncompExt}_{S,g,T}\\)</span> (incompletable-extension predicate, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}incompletable\\text{-}extension}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{IncompExt}_{S,g,T}(U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nT\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(U)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)\\land\n\\forall V\\;\\bigl(\nU\\subseteq V\\land\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(V)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(V)\n\\rightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n(V\\nvdash\\varphi\\land V\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}incompletable\\text{-}extension}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{IncompExt}_{S,g,T}(U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nT\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(U)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)\\land\n\\forall V\\;\\bigl(\nU\\subseteq V\\land\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(V)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(V)\n\\rightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n(V\\nvdash\\varphi\\land V\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>量词只覆盖一致且可有效公理化的扩张；若允许任意扩张，Lindenbaum 引理总能给出一致完备扩张。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory","status":"resolved","id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory","status":"resolved","id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}$ (effective-axiomatizability predicate, see [[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ (metatheoretic consistency predicate, see [[90-df-consistency-statement]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"714deb184f73887a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_S$ (sentence set, see [[90-df-sentence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,g","display":false},{"tex":"T,U","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IncompExt}_{S,g,T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}incompletable\\text{-}extension}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{IncompExt}_{S,g,T}(U)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nT\\subseteq U\\land\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(U)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(U)\\land\n\\forall V\\;\\bigl(\nU\\subseteq V\\land\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(V)\\land\n\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(V)\n\\rightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;\n(V\\nvdash\\varphi\\land V\\nvdash\\neg\\varphi)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1503,"backlinks":[{"id":"d79ded08ce925b1e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IncompExt}_{S,g,T}$ (incompletable-extension predicate, see [[90-df-incompletable-extension]])"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-